window.products.push({"id":1002011,"name":"Thankful Wheat Wreath Printed Pillow Cover, 20\" x 20\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wGg5XlSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Visually appealing with understated charm, the soft tones of the “Thankful” Pillow Cover are sure to add the perfect touch of farmhouse to your decor. Gray lettering keeps the overall look neutral and subtle, and a warm, beige background ensures that this cover will blend easily with existing decor. The pillow reminds us, with just one simple word, that we have so much goodness in our lives and we have every reason to be thankful. The delicate wheat wreath design in neutral tones adds a sophisticated simplicity to your home bringing a modern, updated look to your decor through the entire year, and particularly during the fall season. Using pillow covers to update and freshen your home is easy, thrifty, and convenient. Simply cover one of your existing pillows with our cover, or get a new insert to go with your pillow cover. What a great way to breathe new life into your fall decor in minutes!! A Piper tip: For added fullness select an insert that is 1-2” larger than your pillow cover.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wGg5XlSeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Piper Classics","source_asin":"B07XPCSMB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XPCSMB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XPCSMB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002012,"name":"Pull Out Cabinet Organizer, 2-Tier Sink Organizers with Sliding Storage Basket Drawers, Metal Under Sink Organizers and Storage for Bathroom and Kitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NOwqsQzLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pull-Out Organizers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NOwqsQzLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gaseawolf","source_asin":"B0BS5GZCVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS5GZCVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS5GZCVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002013,"name":"100% Organic Cotton Standard Pillowcase Lilac | Queen Pillowcase | Sateen Weave | 2 Piece | 300 Thread Count | GOTS Certified | Soft Silky Shiny | Lux","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i-S4RxADL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DREAMY SLEEP & A SAFE PLANET GO HAND IN HAND- BERTHALINENS brings to you, it’s exquisite and ethically crafted 100% Organic Cotton – Standard/ Queen Size, All Lilac, 2-Piece Pilowcase. Pillowcase measurements: 21\"x 30\". This just aint any other pillowcase, instead it is a fruit of thoughtful efforts gone behind in crafting a careful ecosystem, through which we care for your dreamy sleep and also for our environment! MATERIAL & WEAVE: 100% Organic Cotton procured directly from farmers to make this beautiful sheet set in-house. This sheet set is made using Sateen WEAVE, which makes sheet silky and shiny. You would love it if you love a soft sleep! ORGANIC JOURNEY OF OUR PRODUCTS –We chose organic cotton (reduce water consumption, avoid harmful chemicals) from India and adopt a more natural way to grow cotton, which has a potential to reduce the insecticide usage globally by 25 percent. Organic Cotton goes to our production facility where it gets converted into yarn. Yarn is converted into fabric and fabric takes shape of final product. Unlike other Organic Brands, this complete process is in-house and organic at every stage. OBSESSED TO GETTING IT RIGHT- To ensure we are always doing the right things in the right manner, our entire production unit, cotton fields, supply chain, employee working conditions are put to a rigorous testing. We are GOTS Certified (A must have for any Organic Product), OEKO TEX CERTIFIED (We ensure a fairer price for the farmers ,higher wages for workers, better labor practices, respectful relationships, community development and respect for local culture) PRODUCT FOR EVERY OCCASION – This product is an ethical gifting choice for all your special occasions – Thanksgiving, Christmas, Birthdays, Weddings, and Anniversaries. More than searching for any occasion, it is the best gift you can give to yourself, your family and to everyone who is a part of our ecosystem, striving to create a change! Happy Buying!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i-S4RxADL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B08H4RCSKC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H4RCSKC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H4RCSKC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
