window.products.push({"id":1002059,"name":"Pemberly Row Engineered Wood Bedroom Armoire in Sindoori Mango","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":366.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zJ9VHazeL._AC_.jpg","description":"Versatile storage where you need it, for clothes! This wardrobe armoire from the Pemberly Row collection offers bountiful storage with elegant style. Behind its two large doors, this wardrobe cabinet features a hidden storage area that provides room for all your outfit essentials. This clothing armoire includes a garment rod so you can conveniently hang and organize apparel like blouses, slacks, and your favorite dresses, keeping them pressed and looking like new. An adjustable shelf behind the doors allows for customizable storage space for a variety of different items. This armoire with hanging rod also features a storage drawer that opens and closes on smooth metal runners for easy access of items like shoes, spare blankets, stacks of sweatshirts and more. It seems nearly everyone could use help with clothing storage. Add this armoire to the bedroom, hallway, entryway, or guest room for a touch of style and extra storage space. Finished in a classy Sindoori Mango and detailed with a herringbone pattern, this wardrobe armoire is the answer to all your bedroom furniture storage needs.Features :- Finish: Sindoori Mango- Material: Engineered Wood- Safety tested for stability to help reduce tip-over accidents- Garment rod included to keep yourclothes organized and wrinkle free- Adjustable shelf behind doors for flexible storage options- Door panels feature herringbone pattern for added design- Drawer features metal runners and safety stops- Quick and easy assembly with slide-on molding and T-lock drawer system- This armoire has been thoroughly tested in an ISO 17025 accredited lab that is Underwriters Laboratories certified- It meets ASTM Internationals industry standard ASTM F2057-19 Safety Specification for Clothing Storage Units, which is intended to reduce hazards to children 5 and under due to tip-over of furniture.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 59.8\"H x 32","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zJ9VHazeL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pemberly Row","source_asin":"B09WYCDTLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WYCDTLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WYCDTLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
