window.products.push({"id":1002139,"name":"2 Pack Air Fryer Silicone Liners, 7.5 inch Reusable Silicone Air Fryer Pot for 3 to 5 QT, Easy Cleaning Round AirFryer Basket, Food Safe Microwave Ove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+xQ9gx1gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Christmas Gifts Air Fryer Accessories: You will receive 2 pack 7.5 in reusable air fryer silicone liners for 3QT or larger. The silicone air fryer baking pans will come in a box. So after taking them out, please leave them for a while to make them round again. They can be used on both sides for grilling, cakes, french fries, roasted chicken, or as a steamer. High Quality & Dishwasher Safe: Our air fryer baskets are made of high quality food grade silicone, which can stand temperatures up to 464°F, are not easy to deform, and do not stick to food. And these air frier cookers liners are dishwasher safe and reusable. Air Circulation Design: This silicon air fryer pad has 14 unique 3D grooves for better air circulation and heat distrubution, allowing you to cook more quickly. This air fryer tray can help to keep your airfryer free from food residue, grease and grime, so you can enjoy a more healthy meal while saving your time to wash the machine after using it. Practical Design: This silicone airfryer insert is designed with two handles on both sides of the bowl, which makes you easy to take it out, thus avoiding burns. And you can hang the air fryer silicone basket on hooks, so it won't take up so much space of storage. And the curve high edge of this air fryer silicone pot can avoid effectively the food spattering. Multifuctional Silicone Air Fryer Liners: These liners for air fryer basket can be used widely for microwave, oven, pressure cooker, freezer and etc. And this air fryer pan is also suitable for outdoor activity such as BBQ, family gathering, picnic, parties as fruit plate or cake container. This silicone baking pan is also suitable for Christmas decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+xQ9gx1gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YENISEI","source_asin":"B0BBTZ6G34","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBTZ6G34","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBTZ6G34","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
