window.products.push({"id":1002158,"name":"Hoover S1120 Hand Held Wet/Dry Hand Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316yEOD4oLL._AC_.jpg","description":"From spilled juice to coffee grounds, the Hoover Handheld Wet/Dry Hand Vac can suck up almost any mess, wet or dry. Its 7.2-volt rechargeable battery can last through multiple jobs, and the cordless design lets you take it anywhere and makes using it in the car easy. Works great for lifting liquid spills out of carpet too. Includes easy-emptying bagless dirt cup and a washable reusable filter. Storage is easy in the wall-mounted charging stand, so you can grab it easily for quick cleanups. The unit measures 11 x 6 x 4 inches and weighs a super lightweight three pounds. Hoover includes a full 1-year warranty with your purchase.   A Hoover Handheld Wet/Dry Hand Vac is the cleaning tool you have been waiting for. The cordless design allows it to be super portable and easily carried between your home, car, and garage. The dual wet/dry design means almost every mess is easily taken care of, whether it’s a spilled drink or excess kitty litter. The unit is also bagless, so there is no need to worry about remembering to buy and change new bags. The easy-empty dirt cup pops off and can simply be dumped into the trash. The reusable filter can be cleaned in your sink with a quick rinse, and is another thing you don’t have to worry about repurchasing. Reusable filter can be easily washed in your sink Bagless design with an easy to empty dirt cup Lightweight and easy to transport to wherever the mess is   No need to use rolls of paper towels the next time there is a spill on the rug, the Hoover Wet/Dry Hand Vac can suck the excess liquid out of the carpet in a snap. Of course, liquid messes on hard floors are also easily taken care of with this hand vac. The long lasting battery means you can carry it all over the house to multiple jobs on a single charge. When you are done for the day, simply place it on the wall mounted charging stand so it is quickly accessible the next time you need it. Wet messes on hard floors are cleaned up quickly. This Hoover hand vac stands in a class of its own. Almost anything that you spill can be quickly picked up with ease. No need for multiple cleaning tools—the Hoover Wet/Dry Hand vac has you covered. Wet and dry messes can easily be picked up together","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/316yEOD4oLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hoover","source_asin":"B000981H6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000981H6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000981H6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
