window.products.push({"id":1002167,"name":"4pc Red Hat Dining Chair Slipcovers,Christmas Chair Back Covers Kitchen Chair Covers for Christmas Holiday Festival Decoration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WKIm5eQwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Size: These Santa hat chair covers measure approx 19.69 in(W) x 23.62 in(L), which fit most of home dining chairs. Package includes: A set of 4 pieces red hat dining chair slipcovers. Material: These Christmas chair back covers are not made of non-woven fabrics, but high quality soft flannelette fabrics, comfortable touching and flexible. The chair covers are durable, can be used repeatedly. Convenient to use: These Christmas kitchen chair covers can directly cover on the chairs, quick and easy way to dress up your dinning chairs and add your house Christmas atmosphere. Applications: Red hat chair back covers are perfect to use in Christmas season, good indoor decorations for home, office and classroom, will leave your friends, family a wonderful Christmas impression.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WKIm5eQwL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CCINEE","source_asin":"B0BDMNH1V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDMNH1V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDMNH1V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002168,"name":"Letter Carrier Personalized Christmas Ornament - Male - Mailman - 4\" Tall - Handpainted Resin - Free Customization by Calliope Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AX8D01h7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Start a tradition in your family of giving a personalized and dated Christmas ornament each year that represents an occasion, a milestone, a celebration, or a vacation! This ornament is made from cast resin. The material is similar to clay, but is lighter in weight. The ornament is carefully hand painted in permanent bright colors. The finish is a matte finish. The ornament comes with a ribbon loop for easy hanging on the Christmas tree. Each item is designed to be personalized to your order in our studio in Santa Rosa, California. All personalization is done by hand by artists. While lettering style will vary from artist to artist, all lettering is done to our high standards of beauty and legibility, using permanent black ink. Always double check the spelling of each name as once the ornament is personalized we can’t change it! We know you’ll enjoy giving this hand painted and carefully personalized and dated Christmas ornament. It will be enjoyed for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AX8D01h7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calliope Designs","source_asin":"B01N3ORLEB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3ORLEB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3ORLEB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002169,"name":"Rosanna Pearlized Blue Napoleon Paté Knives, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y0oNe7SbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Our classic oversized European flatware is fashioned in heavy stainless steel, accented with durable plastic handles with an elegant sheen. Created in Italy by skilled craftsman, all pieces are dishwasher safe Amazon.com Made in Italy, these 5-1/2-inch pâté knives from Rosanna's Napoleon line add a striking touch to an hors d'oeuvre platter of soft cheeses, pâtés, or spreads. Sophisticated and elegant, the knives are made of 18/10 stainless steel with filigreed stainless-steel bands and pearl blue opalescent handles. Their 18/10 stainless-steel construction makes the knives durable and long-lasting if properly maintained. They are dishwasher-safe but wear best if dried immediately after washing and regularly cleaned with polish to prevent tarnishing. Pair them with an elegant stainless-steel or silver platter for a stunning service presentation, or use them with other Rosanna stainless-steel flatware for a matched set. --Emily Wolf","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Y0oNe7SbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosanna","source_asin":"B00004Y2KO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00004Y2KO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00004Y2KO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002170,"name":"Chic Home Chloe 7 Piece Sherpa Comforter Set Beige / Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Lj8TE8VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Treat yourself with this gorgeous super plush, super warm Sherpa lined comforter set. This extremely soft and cozy plush comforter features Sherpa lining and a plush micro suede top in a box quilt design. Stunning colors guaranteed to enhance any room or decor all year round. Super-soft microfiber sheets and design coordinated shams complete the look. Specifications Available In: Beige, Black, Brown, Camel, Green, Navy Blue, Red, Silver Grey Sizes: Queen, King Queen Set Includes â¢ 1pc Comforter (86â x 92â) â¢ 2pc Shams (20â x 26â + 2\") â¢ 1pc Flat Sheet (90â x 102â + 4â) â¢ 1pc Fitted Sheet (60â x 80â + 12â) â¢ 2pc Pillowcases (20â x 30â) King Set Includes â¢ 1pc Comforter (104â x 92â) â¢ 2pc Shams (20â x 36â + 2\") â¢ 1pc Flat Sheet (108â x 102â + 4â) â¢ 1pc Fitted Sheet (78â x 80â + 12â) â¢ 2pc Pillowcases (20â x 40â) Fabric and Design â¢ Silky soft brushed microfiber material â¢ Sophisticated and elegant box quilt pattern Highlights â¢ Luxuriously soft feel for a great night sleep with less tossing and turning â¢ Hypoallergenic down alternative filling is perfect for those allergic to traditional down â¢ Built to last with premium fabrics and expert stitching Care Instructions Dry clean preferred. Machine washable, use front loader machine (or top loader without agitator) to avoid tearing, use cold water on gentle cycle, tumble dry low * Add 2 tennis balls to the dryer to speed up drying and add fluffiness Additional Info â¢ Please review our shipping and return policy prior to placing your order. â¢ Some items depicted in our digital images are props and are not included as part of the listing. Please refer to the product description for a list of what is included as part of this listing. â¢ The digital images we display have the most accurate color possible. However, due to differences in viewing settings, we cannot be responsible for slight variations in color between your screen and the actual product. If you have any questions about anything related to this listing, e.g., the product details, our shipping policy or our return policy, please contact us prior to placing your order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Lj8TE8VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chic Home","source_asin":"B0104LI632","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0104LI632","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0104LI632","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
