window.products.push({"id":1002245,"name":"STRATA CUPS Skinny Tumblers with Lids and Straws (4 Pack) - 20 oz Double Wall Insulated Slim Stainless Steel Silver Tumblers with Straw Cleaner | Reus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cN4n5SneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅DOUBLE-WALLED TO LOCK IN TEMPS: Hate reaching for your morning joe only to find it more frigid than the antarctic? Does the thought of a warm, watered down cocktail bring you to the brink of tears? Relax. Strata Slim Cups with lids has you covered with the awesome power of vacuum insulation! Our metal tumblers are double-walled to keep cold drinks frosty-cool and hot drinks toasty-warm -- from the first refreshing sip to the very last drop. No annoying drink “sweat” or water rings, either! ✅STEEL STRAWS + SPLASH-PROOF LID: Get four insulated bulk tumblers with lids and straws, for everything you need to enjoy drinks at the perfect temperature. Our stainless steel straws are great for sipping iced coffee, tea and water, yet wide enough to suck down thick drinks like smoothies and milkshakes. Never worry about bumpy commutes leaving your car a liquidy mess, with a splash-proof lid that snugly grips each straw. ✅ONE TOUGH METAL TUMBLER: If you’re a hopeless klutz like most of us, you’ll love how rugged our 20 oz skinny tumblers are. These ultra-durable tumblers is built tough to resist accident-prone drops, dents and rust. They’re also a breeze to rinse away bacteria, which is notorious for hiding in plastic tumbler pores. Love sipping on citrus water, lemonade or other acidic drinks? Unlike other metal cups, stainless steel won’t react with acid-heavy drinks. Is there anything these bad boys CAN’T do? ✅SKINNY GRIPS PREVENT SLIPS: It’s a fact: Skinny water tumblers are the holy grail of tumblers. Okay, maybe we’re exaggerating, but they sure are easier to hold! With thin sides and straight walls, they fit comfortably into hands of all shapes and sizes. Unlike larger tea tumblers & reusable water bottles, they fit in virtually any cup holder. They’re perfect for little fingers and kids absolutely LOVE feeling like they have a “grown-up” cup, while arthritis sufferers say they’re a joy to hold. ✅THE PERFECT PERSONALIZED GIFT: Add your own monograms, logos or decals and create beautiful personalized tumblers that make THE best gifts. 20oz tumblers are fantastic Christmas and birthday presents, great for deterring cup thieves at work, and an absolute smash hit at bachelorette parties. Not a big DIYer? Your friends and family will love receiving the regular set as a gift, all by itself. We pack everything in a gorgeous luxury box so it’s ready to gift right out of the package!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cN4n5SneL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STRATA CUPS","source_asin":"B08FKS2SQN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FKS2SQN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FKS2SQN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
