window.products.push({"id":1002286,"name":"Portmeirion Studio A Christmas Story 15-Inch Lasagne Baker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410N8B6K4SL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Acclaimed artist Susan Winget designed \"A Christmas Story\" for Portmeirion in 1995. It is the first and only depiction of the famous poem \"Twas the Night Before Christmas\" by Clement C. Moore on fine porcelain tableware and accessories. Each piece features a different scene and story line from this famous poem. Over the years, this delightful table service has become one of the most collectible series of holiday tableware on the market. Portmeirion will continue to expand the collection each year with the introduction of porcelain pieces reflecting more of the story line. This pattern continues to be a treasured collectible series passed down through generations. Lasagne baker portrays \"He spoke not a word but went straight to work and filled all the stockings, then turned with a jerk.\" Amazon.com The festive theme of this Portmeirion A Christmas Story lasagne baker fits right in with the spirit of holiday meals. Part of a cozily decorated dinnerware line created by artist Susan Winget, the baker features a scene and verses from the Clement C. Moore poem \"Twas the Night Before Christmas.\" The highly detailed and colorful imagery shows a jolly St. Nick unloading his bag of toys beside a glowing Christmas tree. Across the pieces edges run these lines: \"He spoke not a word, but went straight to his work/And filled all the stockings, then turned with a jerk.\" Sprinkles of charming holly leaves on the tab handles complete the festive effect. Crafted from fine translucent porcelain, the baker is substantial in weight and safe in the dishwasher, oven, and microwave. It measures 9-1/4 by 15 by 2 inches. Table settings and other serving dishes, with varying excerpts from the poem, are also available. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/410N8B6K4SL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Portmeirion","source_asin":"B0000UUTRE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000UUTRE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000UUTRE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
