window.products.push({"id":1002409,"name":"fanquare 7oz Coffee Cup Set,Flowers and Birds Porcelain Coffee Tea Sets,Set of 6 Ceramic Tea Cup and Saucer-Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xGwdIaaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Ceramics -China China,as one of the world's most ancient civilizations,it is fair to say that ceramics history is a very important part of China's history.The word \"china\" clearly shows that the country is the \"home\" of pottery and porcelain. There are many varieties of porcelain tea sets,the main ones are: celadon tea set,white porcelain tea set,black porcelain tea set and colored porcelain.These tea sets have had a glorious page in the history of Chinese tea culture. Special Collection Function Tea set collection has existed since ancient times.It can not only realize the function of making tea, but also can be used as home decoration.At the same time, it also has certain value-added space.Under the economic conditions,many tea friends are willing to collect a few pieces of tea sets that they like.There are many kinds of tea sets for collection,and the more popular ones are porcelain tea sets and Zisha tea sets. Use & Maintenance This tea set is resistant to high temperature,wear-resistant,not easy to fade. When use the tea sets at the first time,put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes.Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling.This step can make tea sets more clean and safety. Tea sets are pure hand-painted crafts.Available for disinfection cabinet,dishwasher and microwave oven if the tea set without colorful pattern.Not recommend to use in microwave ovens or dishwasher if the tea set with colorful pattern. There are some small flaws in the production, such as small black spots,small bubbles and so on,it's inevitable because of firing technology . Please feel free to contact us if you need personal customization, we support to do wholesale,OEM and ODM. Anyone who likes to drink tea with tea sets will love what UFENGKE offers.So start enjoying low tea/high tea.Click \"Add to Basket\" to get one today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xGwdIaaUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fanquare","source_asin":"B07MZZB8T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MZZB8T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MZZB8T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
