window.products.push({"id":1002452,"name":"CamRom Kitchen Knife Sharpener for Straight Blade and Serrated Knives,3-Stage Knife Sharpening Tool Helps Repair and Polish Blades,Manual Sharpening T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q2JmBLGHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Keep your knives sharp, don’t let them go dull. Our power knife sharpener - chef's preferred choice, makes life much easier. With this CamRom Knife Sharpener, you will be able to give life to all your blades very easily! For better convenience and efficiency, this sharpener has 3 different slots. The coarse grinding slot is designed for sharping heavily dull blades, the fine grinding slot is designed to revive you knifes and finally the bonus scissors grinding slot is designed to take care of your blunt scissor Why Choose Our Knife Sharpener? This tool offer the advantage of being very simple to use while displaying optimal performance. Thanks to its advanced V-shape technology and dedicated 15-degree! They provide double-faced sharpening at the perfect angle for a faster and safer polishing and honing.  Ergonomic handle, keeps your hand safely away from the moving blade during the sharpening process.High quality materials and Exquisite crafted handle  Non-sliding bottom for adding stability and control. Small and compact, saving space in your cupboards & cabinets.  Our knife sharpening kit helps repair, restore and polish blades, sharpens dull knives quickly.  Own this cooking knife sharpener, blade sharpening shall become a simple and exciting task from now on. Whether you’re a cooking novice or a professional chef, our sharpener is quick and easy to use! Just run the knife through each slot a few times to reveal a razor-sharp blade. With a non-slip base and an ergonomic handle, you’ll have complete control over the tool. Package contents: 1 x Knife Sharpener Tips: 1, Please sharp the knife slightly to avoid any damaging to the knife.Do not move your knife back and forth (pull and push) in the grinder slots. 2, While sharpening no any water or liquid added.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q2JmBLGHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CamRom","source_asin":"B07DHDPCPD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DHDPCPD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DHDPCPD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
