window.products.push({"id":1002590,"name":"VIAGDO Artificial Areca Palm Tree 4ft Tall Fake Palm Tree Decor with 12 Trunks Faux Tropical Palm Silk Plant Potted Dypsis Lutescens Plants for Modern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FJRwjjZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ABOUT THE HEIGHT】This artificial areca palm tree is 4ft/47in/120cm from its pot bottom to the tree top when removing out from the shipping box while the leaves are in upright state. Any adjusting ways like bending its trunk and leaves will cause its height look less than 4ft/47in/120cm. Please be aware before you buy. Any problems regarding this artificial plant, please contact us at any time. 【Realistic Appearance】Wanna have some green to brighten and freshen-up your home? This potted tall artificial areca palm tree will solve your problem! Combined with 12 large and wide palm leaves, this elegant palm tree is waiting to dance in the warm tropical breezes. Each individual frond is carefully crafted with a lush mix of wispy feathery shaped leaves. 【Always Fresh】Packed with plastic bag and shipped in carton, so the faux areca palm tree may come compressed. Just unpack the package, get the tree and dried moss ready. Our artificial plants outfitted with sturdy inner metal wires, and you can adjust the leaves and branches to the shape you like. It will maintain its height, color and shape for years without pruning and shaping. The aesthetic green touch will be maintained for years. 【Lifelike Simulation】 This high quality artificial tree features lifelike structure and style. The natural trunks make it highly realistic, most won’t know it’s not real. The clear texture and even color of the leaves are vivid, truly imitates the look of a real palm tree. The leaves can be adjusted to different angles to shape the most charming look. The dried moss in the flowerpot makes it look more realistic and beautiful. Your friends won’t even tell it’s a fake tree! 【Easy Maintenance】 Having trouble to take care of a real tree? This artificial evergreen tropical palm tree is perfect for you! No need to watering and fertilizing, stay green all year round. This faux palm tree is made of durable and premium polyester material, the base is soft PP pot poured with solid cement to keep the tree straight in pot, durable and secure. You can put it in a bigger and nicer pot to match your home decor. Simply wipe it clean with a damp cloth or duster if they get dusty. 【Great Decoration】This 4ft/47in/120cm tall curvy palm tree plant is delivering a touch of greenery without the messy upkeep, making it the perfect decor to places like living room, bedroom, guest room, office, shop, restaurant, party decor, wedding ceremony etc. You can put in anywhere indoor. If it’s for outdoor, please leave it under cover. Direct sunlight or rain washing is forbidden.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FJRwjjZpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIAGDO","source_asin":"B09Q5XXF38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002590","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q5XXF38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q5XXF38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
