window.products.push({"id":1002694,"name":"Ariel Balloon Bouquet 5th Birthday 5 pcs - Party Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IY2GZAL._AC_SL1240_.jpg","description":"Ariel (Little Mermaid) Birthday Balloon Bouquet 5 pc, 5th Birthday, Number 5 Jumbo Balloon | Viva Party Balloon Collection1 of 34\" Giant Number 5 Foil Balloon & 2 of 18\" Solid Color Foil Balloons manufactured by Kaleidoscope2 of 18\" Licensed Theme Foil Balloons Manufactured by AnagramThis high quality balloon bouquet will last longer when it inflates with high quality helium than NON BRANDED balloons; To verify this balloon bouquet is a genuine product, please look for Anagram & Kaleidoscope LOGOS on balloons once you receive it..Helium & Ribbons are not included. Please message Viva Party for additional customization.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710+IY2GZAL._AC_SL1240_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vivaparty","source_asin":"B071198T63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071198T63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071198T63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002695,"name":"HOLMES HAPF622R Blizzard Remote Control Power Fan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z89MCGQ6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description 12-inch power blade / Remote oscillating directional grill / Breeze modes / 7.5 hour timer Amazon.com People who favor fans over air conditioners like to feel a room breathe or to feel outdoor breezes in the house. The Holmes HAPF622R Blizzard remote control power fan brings a little more of the outdoors in with its innovative breeze modes. In addition to the standard ON setting, the Holmes Blizzard offers two settings which switch speeds randomly to mimic the feeling of natural breezes. As for power, the Blizzard has a five-fin fan blade which moves more air per rotation than the more common four-fin blade. And the front grill can oscillate as well, which increases the width of the cone of air being moved. The fan has a charcoal-gray, rounded casing that echoes the circle of the fan itself; the curved carrying handle arcs above for easy portability. The manual controls are another arc of light-gray buttons on the face of the fan. With the convenient remote control, however, those buttons might never even get used. Both the manual and the remote buttons use icons for the various commands: a circle for on/off, three wavy lines for the breeze functions, a clock for the timer, a fan for the speed setting, and a fan with two arrows for the front grill oscillation. There are three speeds, and the timer can be set to shut off at any half-hour increment up to 7-1/2 hours. Always unplug fan before cleaning. Use a soft cloth moistened with a mild, nonabrasive soap solution. Do not use gasoline, paint thinner, or benzene as a cleaning solution; also do not allow water to drip on or enter fan housing. The remote control requires two AAA batteries (not included). The Holmes HAPF622R power fan measures 18 by 19 by 6 inches. Holmes provides a 3-year limited warranty against defects in material and workmanship under normal use conditions. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z89MCGQ6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holmes","source_asin":"B000NLL3MA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000NLL3MA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000NLL3MA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002696,"name":"YETI Rambler 10 oz Stackable Lowball 2.0, Vacuum Insulated, Stainless Steel with MagSlider Lid, Canopy Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fU2MAeT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lowball 2.0 from YETI is the ideal drinking companion. Easy to stack and store, the Lowball’s double-wall vacuum insulation will keep your hot drinks hot, and your cold drinks cold longer than standard drinkware 18/8 STAINLESS STEEL - Resists dents and drops and the Double-Wall Vacuum Insulation keeps drinks cold to the last drop STACKABLE - Save storage space when you remove the lids DISHWASHER SAFE - Because no one needs more work to do NOTE - While the magnet adds an additional barrier of protection to keep drinks hot or cold, this magnet slider is not leakproof and will not prevent spills","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fU2MAeT9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YETI","source_asin":"B0BTTST881","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002696","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTTST881","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTTST881","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002697,"name":"EARTH MIRACLE Latex Pillow, Natural Latex Massage Pillow, Neck Contour Orthopedic Pillow for Pain and Stress Relief with Free Zippered Bamboo Fiber Pi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NtllieuZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Bamboo 【MASSAGE LATEX PILLOW】This latex pillow is made of natural rubber juice, which is soft and comfortable to use. Rivet-like surface can massage head acupoints, circular hole ventilation structure can effectively distribute the heat generated by the human body. It provides comfortable support for the head, neck and shoulders, if you want a good sleep, buy this pillow! 【ERGONOMIC CURVE DESIGN】This natural latex pillow is designed with curved neck wave and fits well with the cervical contour curve. There is a curve in the middle to keep your neck fully supported. The pillow can be adjusted according to your personal shape, allowing your shoulders, neck and head to rest in a natural position. When you wake up, the pillow will return to its original shape without deformation! 【EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE】Latex bad pillow helps to adjust the spine and relieve pain in the head, neck and shoulders, elastic support for the cervical spine, let you sleep well all night. This natural latex pillow has no peculiar smell. The bonus pillow case is made of bamboo fiber and polyester, zippered design makes it very easy to clean. Please leave the pillow in a dry and ventilated place for 2-3 days and wash the pillowcase before first use. 【CLEAN YOUR PILLOW】This latex pillow can be washed, but it can't be exposed to the sun after washing. This natural latex pillow is made of natural latex, ultraviolet rays can cause the pillow to oxidize and harden in the sun. To restore softness, simply soak the pillow in warm water and let it dry a dry and ventilated place. 【HASSLE-FREE WARRANTY】We offer a 30-day money back and 12-month free replacement warranty. If you have any problems, please contact us at any time, we will try our best to help you. Click \"Add to Cart\" button, it would be the answer for your sleep problems!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NtllieuZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EARTH MIRACLE","source_asin":"B07H12ZBD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H12ZBD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H12ZBD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
