window.products.push({"id":1002814,"name":"HoneiLife Seersucker Duvet Cover Queen - 3 Pieces Thickened Comforter Cover Microfiber Bedding Set Solid Duvet Cover Set with Wide Striped Seersucker,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DxkhQ52ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😍😍New Style!!👉 Are you tired of monotonous plain duvet covers without design sense?The texture of the seersucker is just enough to add some fun, the seemingly irregular folds are embellished with the unique individuality and artistic sense of the duvet cover, which makes it look so special.And and now more options are available,you can choose the general seersucker,and the thin horizontal stripes or the wide vertical stripes according to your preference. 😍😍Premium Fabric👉 100% washed microfiber on the plain side has ultra cozy touch close to the washed cotton.This thickened washed microfiber much more heavier and durable than the ordinary materials. At the same time, this seersucker fabric will be more breathable and comfortable than the ordinary smooth materials. 😍😍Cost Effective👉 Our seersucker duvet cover set features longer durability, better fade and stain resistant than cotton but the price is much lower.The seersucker fibric is much thicker than the common microfiber,this means it is more washable and won't like the common microfiber duvet cover which is too thin to use in the cold winter-A ture all year round duvet cover! Seersucker duvet cover retains its original shape even after washing for years without wrinkles or creases. 😍😍Humanization Design👉 Reduce your precious time on bed making with 51\" long zipper closure to seal your luxury quilt, comforter or duvet more quickly and easily than regular button closure - Friendly design by sewing 4\" ties in 4 corners inside duvet cover to keep your down comforter in the right place without slipping around all night long. 😍😍Package and Washing instructions👉 1 duvet cover set (104\"x 90\")&2 pillow Cases (20\"x 36\").👉 Our seersucker duvet cover is machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle with similar colors. You could wash them before first use. Do not bleach or dry clean. Tumble dry low.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DxkhQ52ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HoneiLife","source_asin":"B08LYZ21JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002814","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LYZ21JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LYZ21JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
