window.products.push({"id":1002816,"name":"Tribal Soul Incense Smudge Sticks - Premium Quality Incense - Set of 6 Different Packs - 90 Grams Total","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eGcUCaNtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tribal Soul Incense Smudge Sticks have been made with traditional herbs, resins and leaves of trees or plants inspired by the Native American traditions. White Sage has been used for centuries by the North America Natives particular in the Southwest, this plant has been considered sacred used specially to drive away energy, cleansing and purifying people and places by the technique of smudging. White Copal: Copal is original from the Aztec Mesoamerican region. It is a type of resin considered sacred . Iy the Mayans and Aztecs it was used as offering to their Gods for energetic protection, offerings, Cleaning and purification. Palo Santo is original from the Amazon's rainforest besides the traditional use of clearing spaces is used to clears negative energies and prepares one for meditation Myrrh is a natural resin most commonly found in the Arabic Peninsula has made its way to this original set to compliment the combinations and purposes of the incense. Traditionally used for Praying and Offering is excellent for spiritual uplifting. Lavender is ideal for protection and cleansing, symbolizes purity and cleanliness. Sooths and calms the mood opening the heart chakra. The combination of White Sage and Lavender offers a harmonious atmosphere, enabling greater ease and relaxation. The combination of White Sage and Palo Santo provides a perfect environment for meditation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eGcUCaNtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Incense","source_asin":"B09HY5CWM7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002816","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HY5CWM7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HY5CWM7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
