window.products.push({"id":1002961,"name":"chalvh Electric Garlic Chopper, 250ml Mini Chopper Food Processor, Vegetable Chopper Rechargeable with USB C, Easy Cleaning, BPA Free, Portable Proces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVOJmPoZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Functional and Ideal Kitchen Helper: The food chopper mini 250ML, it’s serves as a handy chopper for garlic, onion, ginger, peppers, carrots, vegetables, minced meat, potatoes, and baby food, as well as for nuts in baking. Electric garlic food chopper saves time and energy and makes cooking easier and more fun. Healthy and Safety: Small food processor comes with a PCTG Food Grade blender cup and a 304 stainless steel blade, non-slip bottom, without peculiar smell, BPA free cup body, which is harmless to your family and children. The blender cup has a magnetic safety lock, when the motor cover is removed from the blender cup, the motor will stop work, thereby protecting your safety. One Button Operation: Just press and hold the top button to start, and release to stop, no other complicated operations needed. Electric food chopper only takes 5-15 seconds, and you can control the degree of food shredding as you like. The vegetable chopper is designed with a magnetic child safety lock, which ensures that the garlic chopper won’t start without closing the cover. Waterproof and Easy to Clean: The whole body of our garlic mincer is waterproof, cleanup is a breeze. A quick swish in sudsy water with a quick brush and it is clean. Please notes that the blades of the garlic cutter are removeable and sharp while washing. Electric garlic chopper so small and can keep it right in the cabinet, space saving and ready for next use. USB Rechargeable and Portable: Mini garlic chopper can be charged through the USB Type C interface. The battery indicator light on the main unit allows you to observe the battery status at any time. Cordless design, compact and exquisite, not take up space, bid farewell to messy, very suitable for family outdoor dining and long distance travel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UVOJmPoZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chalvh","source_asin":"B09NQ21ZR3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NQ21ZR3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NQ21ZR3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
