window.products.push({"id":1002997,"name":"Royal Albert Moonlight Rose 5-Piece Place Setting, Service for 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819GcU38sUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Royal Albert's Moonlight Rose is a romantically elegant pattern which features rich shades of blue and indigo roses set atop a brilliant white, bone china background. A stylish Montrose Shape is trimmed in 22-carat gold stippling, a hand-painted decoration that is luminous against the hues of blue and pure transparency. Classic and sultry, Moonlight Rose will make even takeout feel like a special occasion. Amazon.com With its unexpected palette and lush imagery, Moonlight Rose china from Royal Albert sets a table romantic enough for lovers dining at midnight. Crafted from pure white bone china, the pattern features lush clusters of roses and foliage in a palette of deep blues and indigos. Lustrous and intricate gold accenting refines the sensuous look, while Montrose shaping creates an unmistakable air of elegance. The starting point of a Moonlight Rose collection, this set totals five pieces and serves one diner. It includes a salad plate, a dinner plate, a bread and butter plate, a saucer, and a teacup. A wide range of Moonlight Rose serving pieces is also available. For convenience, the pattern is safe in the dishwasher, and Royal Doulton guarantees its availability up to two years after purchase. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; bread and butter plate; saucer; teacup. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819GcU38sUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Albert","source_asin":"B000W7K6S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000W7K6S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000W7K6S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002998,"name":"Our Old Barn by Lois Bryan, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noxVi-wFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an old barn. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'..ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71noxVi-wFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKH7A32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKH7A32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKH7A32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1002999,"name":"Cooking with Kids - My First Cooking Tools - Kids Safe Knives and Snack Making Set for Little Chefs - Real Cooking and Baking Tools for Children!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fnaPu+6zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍎 The Educational Kid-Safe Knives and Snack-Making Set for Little Chefs, provides an excellent introduction to cooking and baking. Enjoy quality time with your little ones as they build confidence in the kitchen and master an important life skill! 🍎 Set of 2 (8”and 9”) kid-safe knives have a rounded tip and serrated edge that cut a variety of soft vegetables, fruits, breads, meats and cheeses, but are safe for little hands. The non-slip rubber handles made of FDA grade, BPA free & eco-friendly polypropylene. Our 7” sandwich condiment spreader helps young chefs confidently learn independence in the kitchen as they practice spreading all kinds of jams, butters, soft cheeses and other condiments onto their favorite breads and crackers. 🍎 Multi-function dough cutting wheel, Set of 3 mini fruit and veggie cutters, and 9” rolling pin are fun child-friendly cooking and baking tools that are excellent for creating a variety of dough and pastry shapes. Made of BPA-free silicone, the fluted wheel is 4 inches in diameter and is the perfect size for little hands, in addition to strengthening fine motor skills and building confidence in the kitchen. 🍎 Made exclusively for Cooking with Kids, all our products are durably crafted for years of creative fun in the kitchen. This set is not a Toy. Please use with Adult supervision only. Step-by-Step Kid Friendly recipes and a tip-filled instruction guide written especially for young chefs is included, in addition to virtual class tutorials on our website www.CookingwithKids.info","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fnaPu+6zS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooking with Kids","source_asin":"B09DXB9Z8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1002999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DXB9Z8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DXB9Z8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
